;: unused.lca (3042PC84-70), hand-written: blocks configured with no nets
Version 2
Design 3042PC84 9 0
Speed -70
Editblk FF
Base FG
Config X:F Y: F:A:B:C:D G: DX: DY: ENCLK: RSTDIR: CLK:
Equate F = ((A*~B)+(C@D))
Endblk
Editblk HD
Base FG
Config X: Y:QY F: G:A:B DX: DY:G ENCLK: RSTDIR: CLK:K:NOT
Equate G = A+B
Endblk
Editblk P11
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P50
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O:FAST TRI:
Endblk
